  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0 adds CSharpUtil.FileUtil: path and file name helpers, file kind/category, media type lookup and upload name checks, plus FileTypeInfo/GetFileInfo which resolves kind, category, media type and the dangerous-upload flag in a single lookup. The JSON helpers (IsLikeJson*, IsValidJson*, ConvertTo<T>, TryConvertTo<T>) moved to the new CSharpUtil.Extensions.Json package, so this package now has no third-party dependency at all.",
